# Rendered masters. These are deliverables — 1080x1920 with the mix, for
# TikTok and Reels — but they are also seven megabytes of binary that
# `npm run video:render` reproduces exactly from the composition. The web
# cuts in `public/video/` are committed, because the landing page serves
# them at runtime and Rork deploys this repository.
video/

